ht\n\n## Wyndham Kingston\n\nSingle/double occupancy\n\nAll  prices include tax and service charges\n\nConference attendees traveling from the U.S.  via Air Jamaica are eligible  for  special  fares.  To  inquire  about  these  rates or make reservations,  please advise your Air Jamaica  representative  to use record  'WCULTURE:'.\n\n## 6 2\n\nGeorge Lamming\n\nus  $80.00",
